        "title": "Some countries spend a lot of money to make bicycle usage easier. Why is this? Is this the best solution to traffic congestion?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jkssd7sjxoIkmZxVk3ZlgP5XgHg\"><em><strong>Some countries spend a lot of money to make bicycle usage easier. Why is this? Is this the best solution to traffic congestion?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Bicycle investment and its effects on traffic congestion&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tu0SddWcDoz931xKri8lpq8Wgxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề <em>Bicycle investment and its effects on traffic congestion </em>cho 1 xu hướng:&nbsp;</strong>Nhiều quốc gia chi nhiều tiền để khuyến kh&iacute;ch việc sử dụng xe đạp.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ct2UdtYdhoby7Nxrd2SlZFGAgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Trả lời 2 c&acirc;u hỏi trực tiếp:&nbsp;<em>Tại sao điều n&agrave;y xảy ra? Đ&acirc;y c&oacute; phải giải ph&aacute;p tốt nhất cho tắc nghẽn giao th&ocirc;ng kh&ocirc;ng?</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRaBdsLuZoP0rUxH5FWly8vXgUb\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i <em>Bicycle investment and its effects on traffic congestion</em> v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RvxLdkWg2o1TemxUMSJlS50eguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TS3PdFFE4ooFjlx0jselldGTgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O66RdEdiuoAwdBxsDMPlxpn0gCd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">investing heavily in cycling infrastructure&nbsp;<em>(đầu tư mạnh v&agrave;o cơ sở hạ tầng d&agrave;nh cho xe đạp)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Jtb8drkGDoEiG6xpUl0lLa7Tg0g\">daily means of transport&nbsp;<em>(phương tiện đi lại hằng ng&agrave;y)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sukddc77loPsMxxLtyKlkqdYgFb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C7yrdcTO5oqFcXxj2eulMHpUgdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JsabdjYrpoeNLgx2I7glvIXKgfe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng c&oacute; <strong>hai c&acirc;u hỏi độc lập</strong>, th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lần lượt trả lời từng c&acirc;u hỏi trong mỗi BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NHondlQHQoSvFwxo2qRljImZgOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c l&yacute; do tại sao nhiều quốc gia đầu tư v&agrave;o xe đạp</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W3xqd9C33ot9ZExvD6el2ifBgnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Đ&aacute;nh gi&aacute; rằng mặc d&ugrave; xe đạp hữu &iacute;ch, nhưng c&oacute; c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p kh&aacute;c hiệu quả hơn cho vấn đề tắc nghẽn giao th&ocirc;ng</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c l&yacute; do tại sao nhiều quốc gia đầu tư v&agrave;o xe đạp</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoD7dJ6YFoa0rLxlxj1l11v0gwo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5tQdQOeaoe8mMxQ5UklAxSJgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>C&oacute; hai l&yacute; do ch&iacute;nh khiến c&aacute;c quốc gia ph&acirc;n bổ nguồn lực để <em>khuyến kh&iacute;ch việc đi xe đạp (promote cycling)</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7iId6hhwoyuHZxjXJ5l19sfgKd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAgHdsdjDohJbvxNORLlgQBqg7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:&nbsp;</strong>Trước hết, xe đạp <em>kh&ocirc;ng thải ra kh&iacute; thải carbon (produce zero carbon emissions)</em>, nhờ đ&oacute; c&oacute; thể <em>gi&uacute;p giảm &ocirc; nhiễm kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; (reduce air pollution) </em>ở <em>c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố đ&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n (densely populated cities)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZexDdV8ppoE82kxisQPlQ71Ag0e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact: </strong>V&igrave; &ocirc; t&ocirc; v&agrave; xe m&aacute;y <em>thải ra một lượng lớn kh&iacute; độc hại v&agrave;o bầu kh&iacute; quyển (release large amounts of harmful gases into the atmosphere)</em>, ch&uacute;ng được xem l&agrave; nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n g&acirc;y ra nhiều vấn đề sức khỏe nghi&ecirc;m trọng như <em>c&aacute;c bệnh về h&ocirc; hấp (respiratory diseases)</em> cho cư d&acirc;n đ&ocirc; thị. Do đ&oacute;, việc chuyển sang sử dụng xe đạp c&oacute; thể <em>cải thiện đ&aacute;ng kể chất lượng kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; (greatly improve air quality) </em>v&agrave; tạo ra một m&ocirc;i trường sống trong l&agrave;nh hơn</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XrwCd0yJMo0jNUxFNvNlWLcfg1e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs9bdaafkoRCYVxqvhOlBBh7gLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> Thứ hai, <em>việc đạp xe thường xuy&ecirc;n (cycling on a regular basis)</em> gi&uacute;p người d&acirc;n <em>duy tr&igrave; hoạt động thể chất (stay physically active)</em>, điều n&agrave;y rất c&oacute; lợi cho sức khỏe cộng đồng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZXVdOwYboLow7xjqDRlYMmVgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Nhờ đ&oacute;, <em>&aacute;p lực l&ecirc;n hệ thống y tế c&oacute; thể được giảm bớt (ease the pressure on the healthcare system)</em>, v&igrave; sẽ c&oacute; &iacute;t người mắc c&aacute;c bệnh như <em>b&eacute;o ph&igrave; (obesity)</em> hay <em>tim mạch (heart-related diseases)</em>, vốn thường li&ecirc;n quan đến <em>lối sống &iacute;t vận động (sedentary lifestyles)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Đ&aacute;nh gi&aacute; rằng mặc d&ugrave; xe đạp hữu &iacute;ch, nhưng c&oacute; c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p kh&aacute;c hiệu quả hơn cho vấn đề tắc nghẽn giao th&ocirc;ng</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMDNd3MH4oKzDpxutSSl4mMegvh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng c&oacute; những biện ph&aacute;p kh&aacute;c hiệu quả hơn để <em>giải quyết t&igrave;nh trạng &ugrave;n tắc giao th&ocirc;ng (tackle traffic congestion)</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhRSdel6LoOHtWxhOaHllMpKg9d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0XddwQJBoLl6YxsgWvlneqvgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:</strong> <em>Việc cải thiện hệ thống giao th&ocirc;ng c&ocirc;ng cộng (Improving public transport systems)</em>, bao gồm xe bu&yacute;t, t&agrave;u điện ngầm v&agrave; t&agrave;u hỏa, <em>l&agrave; một lựa chọn tối ưu hơn nhiều (presents a far superior alternative)</em>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng c&oacute; thể chở được số lượng h&agrave;nh kh&aacute;ch lớn trong c&ugrave;ng một thời điểm</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7izdK6wjo64yOxA6F6lS0Y6gLb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Ngo&agrave;i ra, <em>việc đi xe đạp thường kh&ocirc;ng thực tế do qu&atilde;ng đường di chuyển xa v&agrave; điều kiện thời tiết kh&ocirc;ng thuận lợi (cycling is often impractical due to long distances and poor weather conditions)</em>, khiến giao th&ocirc;ng c&ocirc;ng cộng trở th&agrave;nh phương &aacute;n tốt hơn cho người đi l&agrave;m hằng ng&agrave;y ở c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố lớn</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKdBd2jDColbB2xUgeJl0rQMgNe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Một giải ph&aacute;p khả thi kh&aacute;c l&agrave; <em>&aacute;p dụng ph&iacute; &ugrave;n tắc giao th&ocirc;ng (the implementation of congestion charges)</em>, theo đ&oacute; người l&aacute;i xe phải trả ph&iacute; khi đi v&agrave;o <em>những khu vực đ&ocirc;ng phương tiện (high-traffic zones)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Ch&iacute;nh s&aacute;ch n&agrave;y <em>trực tiếp</em> <em>hạn chế việc sử dụng phương tiện c&aacute; nh&acirc;n trong giờ cao điểm (directly discourages the use of private vehicles during peak hours)</em> v&agrave; đ&atilde; chứng minh hiệu quả tại c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phố như London v&agrave; Singapore, nơi <em>lượng xe lưu th&ocirc;ng tr&ecirc;n đường đ&atilde; giảm đ&aacute;ng kể (the volume of cars on the road has been curbed significantly.)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOh0dpvFwodYoYxAfXPlC5RmgbG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUnRdmwHoomd0bx3B9xl3s1Agte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2nCdFhyUoQul9xqlgXlr4PKgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">combating pollution&nbsp;<em>(giải quyết vấn đề &ocirc; nhiễm)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">upgrading public transport&nbsp;<em>(n&acirc;ng cấp phương tiện giao th&ocirc;ng c&ocirc;ng cộng)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3309,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>Many governments around the world are investing heavily in cycling infrastructure to make it easier for their citizens to use bicycles as a daily means of transport. While there are understandable reasons for this trend, I do not believe that it is the most effective solution to traffic congestion.</p>",
            "question_id": 42237,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3310,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>There are two main reasons why countries are allocating resources to promote cycling. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">To begin with, bicycles produce zero carbon emissions, which can help reduce air pollution in densely populated cities. Since cars and motorbikes release large amounts of harmful gases into the atmosphere, they are known to cause serious health issues such as respiratory diseases among urban residents. Therefore, shifting to cycling can greatly improve air quality and create a cleaner living environment. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Secondly, cycling on a regular basis helps citizens stay physically active, which is beneficial for public health. This can ease the pressure on the healthcare system, as fewer people would develop conditions like obesity or heart-related diseases that are commonly associated with sedentary lifestyles.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 42237,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3311,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I believe there are other, more effective measures to tackle traffic congestion.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Improving public transport systems, including buses, metro lines, and trains, presents a far superior alternative, as these can carry a far greater number of passengers at once. Additionally, cycling is often impractical due to long distances and poor weather conditions, which makes public transport a more reliable alternative for daily commuters in big cities.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Another viable solution is the implementation of congestion charges, where drivers are required to pay a fee when entering high-traffic zones. This policy directly discourages the use of private vehicles during peak hours, and has already proven effective in cities like London and Singapore, where the volume of cars on the road has been curbed significantly.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 42237,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3312,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while governments have reasonable motives for promoting cycling, such as combating pollution and improving public health, I am of the opinion that upgrading public transport and introducing congestion charges are more practical solutions to traffic congestion.</p>",
